            "value": "Panos, C. L., Hogue, T. S., Gilliom, R. L., & McCray, J. E. (2018). High-Resolution Modeling of Infill Development Impact on Stormwater Dynamics in Denver, Colorado. Journal of Sustainable Water in the Built Environment, 4(4). http://doi.org/10.1061/Jswbay.0000863",
            "type": "citation/reference",
